{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/5bd1415c303cba299a198f71bf2269e9.poster.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/5bd1415c303cba299a198f71bf2269e9.webm?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/5bd1415c303cba299a198f71bf2269e9.mp4?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the darkest dream full of unimaginable dangers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a desperate bid to save a mankind stained with wounds, the secretive project Vapor World was invented. This machine empowered humans to venture into a realm of dreams, woven from the fabric of their thoughts. But no one could fathom the sinister shadow that the greatest invention would cast.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A boy shrouded in mystery, lost his memory, found himself engulfed alone in this darkest dream. Can you unravel the hidden secrets of this strange world and back to reality?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/17ff287008ef566324f7f12868150778.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=105 /></span><strong>Defeat enemies called traumas and overcome increasingly difficult bosses.</strong> The Seed of traumas dominates this nightmare. When you meet the boss enemy-the Seed, they will try to repel you with many different patterns, so be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/3a622431b42365dcffa26c9005c1ae01.poster.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/3a622431b42365dcffa26c9005c1ae01.webm?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/3a622431b42365dcffa26c9005c1ae01.mp4?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/2846ba2bf8307f45ea991f76bd945f40.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=105 /></span>Check your surroundings to take advantage of hiding spots to sneak up on your enemies and extract their core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/cef132ce3d341844caa245403ca58762.poster.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/cef132ce3d341844caa245403ca58762.webm?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/cef132ce3d341844caa245403ca58762.mp4?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/a4a4364be5438a4324a8c48c9f937763.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=105 /></span><strong>Explore the world to discover unique enemies and items.</strong> Use them to learn new abilities called Projections. They can be used as a combo to parry or blind enemies. Take this opportunity to defeat them easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/50f184b2d2ba25949785f3560e7c0895.poster.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/50f184b2d2ba25949785f3560e7c0895.webm?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/50f184b2d2ba25949785f3560e7c0895.mp4?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/b1cad49b31b04a482f717253e3d3853f.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=105 /></span>Climb a tall ladder, break down obstacles blocking your way, hang on a wall and move specific objects to help on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/c679a0173110033b67d882507a33db47.poster.avif?t=1771901278\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/c679a0173110033b67d882507a33db47.webm?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996090/extras/c679a0173110033b67d882507a33db47.mp4?t=1771901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr